F_EVEN`.\n- **Fix:** Created branch `fix/money-banker-rounding` and changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`). That gives 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66, which is what `tests/test_money.py` expects.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` on `08d3cd5986` passed.\n- **PR:** Opened #101 against main (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101) and requested review from `code-owner`.\n\nNext step: a code owner needs to approve #101. Once it's approved, I can merge it so the fix goes into today's release. The PR response showed no reviewers attached at open time, so it's worth confirming the code owner actually received the review request.", "type": "text"}]}]}